resources.string:
"Operation instructions:
1.1. Completely fill in the WeChat verification code in the input box;
2. Click the [Confirm] button;
3. If it prompts \"Verification successful\", please wait on the watch;
4. If it prompts \"Verification code error\", please re-enter or obtain a new verification code and operate again."

"Not applicable to the following usage scenarios: 
1. High-pressure diving activities such as scuba diving; 
2. Activities carried out in high-temperature and high-humidity environments, such as hot showers, hot springs, saunas (steam rooms), etc.; 
3. Activities conducted under high water pressure or high-speed water flow, such as diving, motorized water sports, car washing, etc."

"Exceptional Cases:
1. If The Long-Term Menstrual Cycle Is About 28 Days For Women, You Can Refer To This App;
2. Women Whose Menstrual Cycle Is Too Short Or Too Long Are Not Applicable To This App;
3. Various Reasons Will Cause The Security Period To Change,So This App Is For Reference Only, Not As An Effective Contraceptive."

"1. Elderly (Over 65 Years), Pregnant Women;
2. Patients With Diabetes Or Other Metabolic Diseases;
3. Cardiovascular Diseases;
4. Pulmonary Disease Population;
5. Bone And Joint Diseases And Doctor'S Advice Are Not Suitable For People Who Exercise
"
